.PP
Emacs\-flavored keymap.
Modeless \[em] the editor stays in INSERT permanently; \f[CR]<Esc>\f[R]
is a no\-op.
NORMAL mode is unreachable while this keymap is active.
.PP
Not loaded by default.
Switch to it at runtime with \f[CR]:keymap emacs\f[R], or pre\-load it
in \f[CR]src/config.c\f[R] by setting
\f[CR]plugin_load(&plugin_emacs_keybinds, 1);\f[R].
