.SH Command palette
\f[CR]M\-x\f[R] \[em] opens hed\[cq]s command picker (same as
\f[CR]:c\f[R]).
.SH Notes
The plugin sets \f[CR]ed_set_modeless(1)\f[R] on init so every
\f[CR]:\f[R] command that would normally drop you into NORMAL mode keeps
you in INSERT.
.PP
If you want a hybrid (Emacs keys but mode\-aware), don\[cq]t set
modeless: edit \f[CR]src/config.c\f[R] to call
\f[CR]ed_set_modeless(0)\f[R] after the plugin loads.
